<%# The root of the one Inertia page, the Inbox, as Rails serves it. `npm run
    build` writes its bundle to app/assets/builds. The tag is here and not in
    the layout, which the compiled build rewrites and where it has no
    controller to ask. The compiled runtime renders
    email/mailboxes/index.html.erb instead and never sees this file. %>
<%= inertia_root(page: page) %>
<script type="module" src="<%= asset_path("inbox.js") %>"></script>
